WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome back, everyone.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.300
I am here with Naomi Watts
right there.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.834
Aw, come on.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:06.334
One of our favorites.

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:09.467
Naomi, you've recently learned
how to make pottery for a role.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:12.467
And you've been posting videos
of your work on Instagram.

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.534
And we have everything
we need here.

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:16.767
I've never done this.
I'm so excited about this.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.434
We're both going to make a bowl.

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:21.067
-We hope. Let's try.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:24.334
Let's not get too attached.
Beautiful accidents --

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.400
-A bowl seems like something
that can --

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.834
-Anyone can do? I know.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:32.100
But I have not done 10,000 hours
on the wheel.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.200
I'm not a master.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.667
-Oh, you're not a pottery master
at all.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:37.200
You're still learning.
-I've done about three hours.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:40.834
But let's wing it.
-Okay, here we go.

00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:41.968
Alright, what do we do?
We got water?

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:43.634
-Wet your hands.
-Wet your hands first.

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:49.067
And then you gently
press the pedal there.

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:50.801
Okay?
-Yep.

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.167
-And that'll give you
some speed.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:53.567
Oh, it's a bit harder
in high heels.

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:55.167
-My sponge has already got
jammed up.

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:58.400
-Oh, yep, yep. Mine, too.
-Do you need one?

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.534
Be careful now.
-So make sure you're nice and --

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:03.200
-Yeah.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.501
-Okay.
-Hold on. Alright, wait.

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:05.934
You're not telling me what
to do, anything at all.

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:07.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:08.200
You just said make sure
you're nice --

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.934
-Press, press, press. I know.

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:11.167
Okay.
-Make it wet.

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:14.234
-And then, like, just put
your hands gently on it.

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:15.601
Okay, and feel it.

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:16.934
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:20.467
Feel it.

00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:24.100
-I feel like -- I feel like
I've already made a bowl.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.000
-Wow, you went straight in.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.200
-I would eat out of this.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.734
Yeah, this is something
I would --

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:30.567
I would eat cereal out of that.
It looks pretty good.

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:31.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:31.601 --> 00:01:33.434
It could also be an ashtray.

00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:37.133
You can also do shots from this,
get frocked up if you want.

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:38.367
Whatever you want to do.

00:01:38.367 --> 00:01:39.834
-Let me help you.
-Oh.

00:01:39.834 --> 00:01:42.133
[ Audience ohs ]

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.467
-Okay, I don't want to get this
dirty.

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:47.801
But here, you need to put
your hands around it.

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:49.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.267
-This is, like -- Yeah.

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:58.367
[ Cheers and applause ]
-And lean into it.

00:01:58.367 --> 00:02:00.367
Yeah, you can close your eyes,
yeah.

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:02.934
-Oh, I was closing my eyes.
-But press the pedal.

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:05.501
-Oh, sorry, sorry,
of course, yes.

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:06.534
How is that?

00:02:06.534 --> 00:02:07.868
-And keep it steady
on the pedal.

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:09.400
-Yeah. Am I doing anything else?

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:13.767
Wow.

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:16.000
Whoa, whoa.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.033
Wow. Alright.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:23.367
♪♪

00:02:23.367 --> 00:02:24.968
-Make it -- Oh, whoa.
-What, what?

00:02:24.968 --> 00:02:26.934
-Keep the pedal going.
-Oh, keep the pedal going, yeah.

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:30.200
[ Laughter ]
-And gentle, gentle.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.300
-And my eyes are closed.
I am gentle --

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.133
[ Laughter ]
It just came out.

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:35.968
This came out.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:35.968 --> 00:02:37.567
It's a napkin ring.

00:02:37.567 --> 00:02:38.968
We made a napkin ring!

00:02:38.968 --> 00:02:40.801
Look at this. It's gorgeous.

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:42.400
She shaped it like there.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.601
-You know, you can actually
put it back on

00:02:44.601 --> 00:02:46.434
if you want and then
just start again.

00:02:46.434 --> 00:02:47.968
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my God.

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:50.534
Start again. Naomi Watts!

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:54.000
"Infinite Storm" is in
select theaters March 23rd.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.067
Start again. We'll be right back
with more "Tonight Show."

00:02:57.067 --> 00:02:58.133
Stick around.
Let me see what you --

00:02:58.133 --> 00:03:00.501
Oh, you made a great one.
Oh, my God.

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:02.067
You made a great one.

00:03:02.067 --> 00:03:06.300
♪♪

